span><span begin="2:37.495" end="2:37.825">boku</span><span begin="2:37.825" end="2:38.080">ra</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>DECO*27</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:38.080"><div begin="0.541" end="2:38.080"><p begin="0.541" end="9.231" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.541" end="0.856">きっ</span><span begin="0.856" end="1.243">と</span><span begin="2.371" end="2.832">届</span><span begin="2.832" end="3.120">く</span><span begin="3.120" end="3.544">は</span><span begin="3.544" end="3.982">ず</span> <span begin="5.875" end="6.177">きっ</span><span begin="6.177" end="6.609">と</span><span begin="7.695" end="7.843">見</span><span begin="7.843" end="8.122">え</span><span begin="8.122" end="8.437">る</span><span begin="8.437" end="8.819">は</span><span begin="8.819" end="9.231">ず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我坚信 你一定能看到</span></p><p begin="9.826" end="15.282" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.826" end="10.129">そん</span><span begin="10.129" end="10.591">な</span><span begin="10.906" end="11.347">会っ</span><span begin="11.347" end="11.413">て</span><span begin="11.413" end="11.566">み</span><span begin="11.566" end="11.698">た</span><span begin="11.698" end="11.859">い</span><span begin="11.859" end="12.041">未</span><span begin="12.041" end="12.332">来</span><span begin="12.332" end="12.602">を</span> <span begin="12.602" end="12.986">僕</span><span begin="12.986" end="13.346">は</span><span begin="13.502" end="13.673">ひ</span><span begin="13.673" end="13.821">と</span><span begin="13.821" end="13.994">り</span><span begin="13.994" end="14.183">き</span><span begin="14.183" end="14.357">り</span><span begin="14.357" end="14.469">の</span><span begin="14.469" end="14.630">セ</span><span begin="14.630" end="14.798">カ</span><span begin="14.798" end="15.041">イ</span><span begin="15.041" end="15.282">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想在这个世界上独自看到这样的未来</span></p><p begin="15.518" end="20.011" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.518" end="15.777">ずっ</span><span begin="15.777" end="16.177">と</span><span begin="16.540" end="16.759">そ</span><span begin="16.759" end="17.044">う</span><span begin="17.044" end="17.335">歌</span><span begin="17.335" end="17.516">う</span><span begin="17.516" end="17.857">たっ</span><span begin="17.857" end="18.019">て</span><span begin="18.019" end="18.190">い</span><span begin="18.190" end="20.011">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我自始至终歌唱着</span></p><p begin="28.117" end="33.363" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.117" end="28.520">今</span><span begin="29.117" end="29.277">聞</span><span begin="29.277" end="29.483">こ</span><span begin="29.483" end="29.642">え</span><span begin="29.642" end="29.843">た</span><span begin="29.843" end="30.131">よ</span> <span begin="31.343" end="31.500">ほ</span><span begin="31.500" end="31.862">ら</span><span begin="32.360" end="32.667">少</span><span begin="32.667" end="32.889">し</span><span begin="32.889" end="33.072">だ</span><span begin="33.072" end="33.363">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我现在可以隐隐约约听到 你的存在</span></p><p begin="34.190" end="39.087" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.190" end="34.548">君</span><span begin="34.548" end="34.709">を</span><span begin="34.709" end="35.133">感</span><span begin="35.133" end="35.309">じ</span><span begin="35.309" end="35.498">た</span><span begin="35.498" end="35.843">よ</span> <span begin="37.049" end="37.151">メ</span><span begin="37.151" end="37.359">ロ</span><span begin="37.359" end="37.796">ディー</span><span begin="37.796" end="37.961">が</span><span begin="37.961" end="38.403">リン</span><span begin="38.403" end="38.583">ク</span><span begin="38.583" end="38.751">す</span><span begin="38.751" end="39.087">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我感受到了我们的旋律在共鸣</span></p><p begin="41.098" end="46.371" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.098" end="41.470">今</span><span begin="42.058" end="42.441">繋</span><span begin="42.441" end="42.612">が</span><span begin="42.612" end="42.825">る</span><span begin="42.825" end="43.128">よ</span> <span begin="44.354" end="44.798">今</span><span begin="45.362" end="45.654">重</span><span begin="45.654" end="45.849">な</span><span begin="45.849" end="46.062">る</span><span begin="46.062" end="46.371">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻相互连结 终于重叠</span></p><p begin="46.941" end="56.838" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.941" end="47.325">伝</span><span begin="47.325" end="47.481">え</span><span begin="47.481" end="47.673">た</span><span begin="47.673" end="48.160">かっ</span><span begin="48.160" end="48.299">た</span><span begin="48.299" end="48.460">こ</span><span begin="48.460" end="48.812">と</span> <span begin="49.984" end="50.320">山</span><span begin="50.320" end="50.530">ほ</span><span begin="50.530" end="50.734">ど</span><span begin="50.734" end="50.917">あ</span><span begin="50.917" end="51.380">るん</span><span begin="51.380" end="51.574">だ</span><span begin="51.574" end="51.752">け</span><span begin="51.752" end="52.124">ど</span><span begin="52.651" end="52.799">ど</span><span begin="52.799" end="52.969">う</span><span begin="52.969" end="53.171">し</span><span begin="53.171" end="53.320">よ</span><span begin="53.320" end="53.796">う</span> <span begin="55.323" end="56.838">あぁ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想说的话堆积如山却不知如何讲起</span></p><p begin="56.431" end="1:02.500" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.881" end="58.046">見</span><span begin="58.046" end="58.205">た</span><span begin="58.205" end="58.595">こ</span><span begin="58.595" end="58.817">と</span><span begin="58.817" end="59.009">も</span><span begin="59.009" end="59.159">な</span><span begin="59.159" end="59.444">い</span><span begin="59.444" end="59.851">顔</span><span begin="59.851" end="59.989">で</span> <span begin="59.989" end="1:00.328">君</span><span begin="1:00.328" end="1:00.517">は</span><span begin="1:00.517" end="1:00.883">君</span><span begin="1:00.883" end="1:01.060">を</span><span begin="1:01.060" end="1:01.237">ダ</span><span begin="1:01.237" end="1:01.441">メ</span><span begin="1:01.441" end="1:01.648">と</span><span begin="1:01.648" end="1:01.893">言</span><span begin="1:01.893" end="1:02.025">う</span><span begin="1:02.025" end="1:02.233">け</span><span begin="1:02.233" end="1:02.500">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你总用着素未谋面的表情 否定现在的自我</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="56.431" end="57.668"><span begin="56.431" end="56.852">(Say,</span> <span begin="56.852" end="57.422">woh-</span><span begin="57.422" end="57.668">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:03.073" end="1:08.889" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.073" end="1:03.289">未</span><span begin="1:03.289" end="1:03.631">来</span><span begin="1:03.631" end="1:03.793">に</span><span begin="1:03.793" end="1:03.994">い</span><span begin="1:03.994" end="1:04.198">る</span><span begin="1:04.198" end="1:04.384">理</span><span begin="1:04.384" end="1:04.792">想</span><span begin="1:04.792" end="1:05.026">の</span><span begin="1:05.026" end="1:05.416">君</span><span begin="1:05.416" end="1:05.660">を</span> <span begin="1:05.900" end="1:06.218">今</span><span begin="1:06.218" end="1:06.422">の</span><span begin="1:06.422" end="1:06.824">君</span><span begin="1:06.824" end="1:07.028">に</span><span begin="1:07.028" end="1:07.196">押</span><span begin="1:07.196" end="1:07.400">し</span><span begin="1:07.400" end="1:07.610">付</span><span begin="1:07.610" end="1:07.811">け</span><span begin="1:07.811" end="1:08.012">過</span><span begin="1:08.012" end="1:08.207">ぎ</span><span begin="1:08.207" end="1:08.493">な</span><span begin="1:08.493" end="1:08.658">い</span><span begin="1:08.658" end="1:08.889">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请不要将未来的理想 一股脑地强加给自己</span></p><p begin="1:09.282" end="1:15.196" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.680" end="1:10.843">見</span><span begin="1:10.843" end="1:11.017">た</span><span begin="1:11.017" end="1:11.419">こ</span><span begin="1:11.419" end="1:11.617">と</span><span begin="1:11.617" end="1:11.785">も</span><span begin="1:11.785" end="1:11.989">な</span><span begin="1:11.989" end="1:12.163">い</span><span begin="1:12.163" end="1:12.460">景</span><span begin="1:12.460" end="1:12.757">色</span> <span begin="1:12.757" end="1:12.946">見</span><span begin="1:12.946" end="1:13.153">せ</span><span begin="1:13.153" end="1:13.357">合</span><span begin="1:13.357" end="1:13.540">う</span><span begin="1:13.540" end="1:13.732">い</span><span begin="1:13.732" end="1:13.960">つ</span><span begin="1:13.960" end="1:14.140">か</span><span begin="1:14.140" end="1:14.338">が</span><span begin="1:14.338" end="1:14.530">来</span><span begin="1:14.530" end="1:14.752">る</span><span begin="1:14.752" end="1:14.949">ま</span><span begin="1:14.949" end="1:15.196">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些心碎的瞬间 直到能一起看到新风景的那天来临</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:09.282" end="1:10.471"><span begin="1:09.282" end="1:09.670">(Say,</span> <span begin="1:09.670" end="1:10.252">woh-</span><span begin="1:10.252" end="1:10.471">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:15.815" end="1:21.427" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.815" end="1:15.981">つ</span><span begin="1:15.981" end="1:16.191">ら</span><span begin="1:16.191" end="1:16.335">い</span><span begin="1:16.335" end="1:16.527">こ</span><span begin="1:16.527" end="1:16.728">と</span> <span begin="1:16.728" end="1:16.911">泣</span><span begin="1:16.911" end="1:17.100">き</span><span begin="1:17.100" end="1:17.292">た</span><span begin="1:17.292" end="1:17.499">く</span><span begin="1:17.499" end="1:17.706">な</span><span begin="1:17.706" end="1:17.919">る</span><span begin="1:17.919" end="1:18.102">こ</span><span begin="1:18.102" end="1:18.441">と</span> <span begin="1:18.971" end="1:19.119">た</span><span begin="1:19.119" end="1:19.308">ま</span><span begin="1:19.308" end="1:19.512">に</span><span begin="1:19.512" end="1:19.737">は</span><span begin="1:19.737" end="1:20.129">預</span><span begin="1:20.129" end="1:20.330">け</span><span begin="1:20.330" end="1:20.486">会</span><span begin="1:20.486" end="1:20.659">お</span><span begin="1:20.659" end="1:21.427">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些让人想哭的瞬间 就让我们互相分担吧</span></p><p begin="1:21.945" end="1:28.167" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.945" end="1:22.060">ハ</span><span begin="1:22.060" end="1:23.296">ロー、</span><span begin="1:23.493" end="1:23.623">セ</span><span begin="1:23.623" end="1:23.801">カ</span><span begin="1:23.801" end="1:24.655">イ</span> <span begin="1:24.904" end="1:25.225">僕</span><span begin="1:25.225" end="1:25.399">の</span><span begin="1:25.399" end="1:25.855">声</span><span begin="1:25.855" end="1:25.999">は</span><span begin="1:25.999" end="1:26.431">ちゃん</span><span begin="1:26.431" end="1:26.645">と</span><span begin="1:26.645" end="1:27.134">届</span><span begin="1:27.134" end="1:27.245">い</span><span begin="1:27.245" end="1:27.404">て</span><span begin="1:27.404" end="1:27.605">る</span><span begin="1:27.605" end="1:27.826">か</span><span begin="1:27.826" end="1:28.167">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你好世界 我的声音是否可以真切传达</span></p><p begin="1:28.466" end="1:34.241" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.466" end="1:29.051">思っ</span><span begin="1:29.051" end="1:29.189">た</span><span begin="1:29.189" end="1:29.381">よ</span><span begin="1:29.381" end="1:29.570">り</span><span begin="1:29.570" end="1:29.912">も</span><span begin="1:30.038" end="1:30.361">大</span><span begin="1:30.361" end="1:30.808">丈</span><span begin="1:30.808" end="1:31.151">夫</span> <span begin="1:31.151" end="1:31.541">君</span><span begin="1:31.541" end="1:31.706">は</span><span begin="1:31.706" end="1:31.913">ひ</span><span begin="1:31.913" end="1:32.111">と</span><span begin="1:32.111" end="1:32.321">り<