"2:07.287">も</span><span begin="2:07.287" end="2:07.474">な</span><span begin="2:07.474" end="2:07.623">い</span><span begin="2:07.623" end="2:07.779">も</span> <span begin="2:07.779" end="2:08.280">そん</span><span begin="2:08.280" end="2:08.394">な</span><span begin="2:08.394" end="2:08.503">の</span><span begin="2:08.503" end="2:08.587">ど</span><span begin="2:08.587" end="2:08.707">う</span><span begin="2:08.707" end="2:08.783">で</span><span begin="2:08.783" end="2:08.889">も</span><span begin="2:08.889" end="2:09.060">い</span><span begin="2:09.060" end="2:09.154">い</span><span begin="2:09.154" end="2:09.284">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">左思右想的烦恼 那都是无关紧要的</span></p><p begin="2:09.494" end="2:11.980" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.494" end="2:09.654">や</span><span begin="2:09.654" end="2:09.822">り</span><span begin="2:09.822" end="2:10.011">た</span><span begin="2:10.011" end="2:10.203">い</span><span begin="2:10.203" end="2:10.377">よ</span><span begin="2:10.377" end="2:10.620">う</span><span begin="2:10.620" end="2:10.824">に</span><span begin="2:10.824" end="2:11.019">や</span><span begin="2:11.019" end="2:11.157">ろ</span><span begin="2:11.157" end="2:11.980">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们尽情舞动</span></p><p begin="2:12.656" end="2:15.442" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.656" end="2:12.752">飛</span><span begin="2:12.752" end="2:12.833">び</span><span begin="2:12.833" end="2:13.118">込ん</span><span begin="2:13.118" end="2:13.323">で</span><span begin="2:13.323" end="2:13.429">い</span><span begin="2:13.429" end="2:13.542">こ</span><span begin="2:13.542" end="2:13.833">う</span> <span begin="2:13.833" end="2:14.202">僕</span><span begin="2:14.202" end="2:14.358">ら</span><span begin="2:14.358" end="2:14.545">の</span><span begin="2:14.545" end="2:14.694">セ</span><span begin="2:14.694" end="2:14.805">カ</span><span begin="2:14.805" end="2:14.990">イ</span><span begin="2:14.990" end="2:15.442">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">勇敢飞入 属于我们自己的世界</span></p><p begin="2:15.796" end="2:18.491" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.796" end="2:15.986">正</span><span begin="2:15.986" end="2:16.253">解</span><span begin="2:16.253" end="2:16.451">か</span><span begin="2:16.451" end="2:16.562">不</span><span begin="2:16.562" end="2:16.769">正</span><span begin="2:16.769" end="2:17.036">解</span><span begin="2:17.036" end="2:17.307">か</span><span begin="2:17.307" end="2:17.446">わ</span><span begin="2:17.446" end="2:17.572">か</span><span begin="2:17.572" end="2:17.763">ら</span><span begin="2:17.763" end="2:17.876">な</span><span begin="2:17.876" end="2:18.050">く</span><span begin="2:18.050" end="2:18.155">て</span><span begin="2:18.155" end="2:18.491">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管你不知是非对错</span></p><p begin="2:18.573" end="2:21.702" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.573" end="2:18.913">僕</span><span begin="2:18.913" end="2:19.120">に</span><span begin="2:19.120" end="2:19.444">あ</span><span begin="2:19.444" end="2:19.540">る</span><span begin="2:19.540" end="2:19.786">想</span><span begin="2:19.786" end="2:19.936">い</span><span begin="2:19.936" end="2:20.101">も</span> <span begin="2:20.101" end="2:20.476">君</span><span begin="2:20.476" end="2:20.695">に</span><span begin="2:20.695" end="2:20.941">あ</span><span begin="2:20.941" end="2:21.030">る</span><span begin="2:21.030" end="2:21.373">願</span><span begin="2:21.373" end="2:21.517">い</span><span begin="2:21.517" end="2:21.702">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你怀抱的思念和珍藏已久的心愿</span></p><p begin="2:21.709" end="2:25.497" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.709" end="2:21.892">きっ</span><span begin="2:21.892" end="2:22.075">と</span><span begin="2:22.075" end="2:22.276">消</span><span begin="2:22.276" end="2:22.490">え</span><span begin="2:22.490" end="2:22.718">な</span><span begin="2:22.718" end="2:22.982">いん</span><span begin="2:22.982" end="2:23.078">だ</span><span begin="2:23.078" end="2:23.249">よ</span> <span begin="2:23.249" end="2:23.463">ずっ</span><span begin="2:23.463" end="2:23.660">と</span><span begin="2:23.660" end="2:23.849">セ</span><span begin="2:23.849" end="2:24.068">カ</span><span begin="2:24.068" end="2:24.184">イ</span><span begin="2:24.184" end="2:24.358">は</span><span begin="2:24.358" end="2:24.532">終</span><span begin="2:24.532" end="2:24.674">わ</span><span begin="2:24.674" end="2:24.843">ら</span><span begin="2:24.843" end="2:24.961">な</span><span begin="2:24.961" end="2:25.085">い</span><span begin="2:25.085" end="2:25.497">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">都绝不会因此消散</span></p><p begin="2:25.886" end="2:31.117" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.886" end="2:26.259">今</span><span begin="2:26.849" end="2:27.039">繋</span><span begin="2:27.039" end="2:27.384">が</span><span begin="2:27.384" end="2:27.592">る</span><span begin="2:27.592" end="2:27.873">よ</span> <span begin="2:29.028" end="2:29.392">今</span><span begin="2:30.030" end="2:30.355">重</span><span begin="2:30.355" end="2:30.541">な</span><span begin="2:30.541" end="2:30.751">る</span><span begin="2:30.751" end="2:31.117">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻相互连结 终于重叠</span></p><p begin="2:32.199" end="2:38.080" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.199" end="2:32.353">ほ</span><span begin="2:32.353" end="2:32.611">ら</span><span begin="2:33.186" end="2:33.319">聞</span><span begin="2:33.319" end="2:33.514">こ</span><span begin="2:33.514" end="2:33.700">え</span><span begin="2:33.700" end="2:33.892">る</span><span begin="2:33.892" end="2:34.192">よ</span> <span begin="2:35.355" end="2:35.509">ほ</span><span begin="2:35.509" end="2:35.797">ら</span><span begin="2:36.321" end="2:36.694">伝</span><span begin="2:36.694" end="2:36.891">わ</span><span begin="2:36.891" end="2:37.066">る</span><span begin="2:37.066" end="2:37.495">よ</span><span begin="2:37.495" end="2:37.825">僕</